{"id":272,"tag":"10-20","scenario":"kiddiespeak","level":"kindergarten","phrase":"Don't be angry, mom!","phrase_cn":"妈妈，别生气了。","phrase_tw":"媽媽，不要生氣。"},
{"id":273,"tag":"10-21","scenario":"kiddiespeak","level":"kindergarten","phrase":"Daddy, where's mommy?","phrase_cn":"爸爸，我妈妈呢？","phrase_tw":"爸爸，媽媽在哪裡？"}
